  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in a\xE7\u0131lan kart \"T\u0131ls\u0131m D\xF6rtl\xFCs\xFC\"
    {{isim}}.\n\nKaybetme korkusuyla ge\xE7en zamanlar... Asl\u0131nda ortada bir
    kay\u0131p ya da b\xFCy\xFCk bir tehlike de yokken, kuruntulu bir d\xF6nem ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Birka\xE7 sand\u0131k elmaya sahipken, onlar\u0131 yerde b\u0131rakman durumunda
    \xE7al\u0131nabilecekleri korkusuyla a\u011Faca \xE7\u0131kmam\u0131\u015F, ilave
    \xFC\xE7 be\u015F sand\u0131kl\u0131k kazan\xE7tan olmu\u015Fsun. Elinde olanlara
    s\u0131k\u0131 s\u0131k\u0131ya sar\u0131lm\u0131\u015F, ihtiyac\u0131 olanlarla
    dahi payla\u015Fmayarak, hesab\u0131 \xE7ok materyalist bir bak\u0131\u015F a\xE7\u0131s\u0131yla
    yapm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. \xC7evrendeki insanlara \xE7ok ba\u011Flanm\u0131\u015F,
    yeni birilerini hayat\u0131nda istememi\u015F, \"az olsun \xF6z olsun\" demi\u015Fsin."
